{
  description: 'The ink newsletter band — email capture over the classy CTA panel, speaking the client form-manager dialect (data-form-state; its section.js binds the form through the §7 presence init — the reference consumer of the section-JS lane). SHARED band: defaults stay neutral, every page passes its own copy.',

